#. UX9FE
#. tdf#42713: warn before switching to Design View when SQL contains comments
#. To translators: for $object$, one of the values of the RSC_QUERY_OBJECT_TYPE resource will be inserted.
#: dbaccess/inc/strings.hrc:144
msgctxt "STR_QRY_COMMENTS_WARNING"
msgid ""
"$object$ contains SQL comments.\n"
"\n"
"If you edit it in Design View, the comments will be lost.\n"
"\n"
"Continue anyway?"
msgstr "$object$ содержит комментарии SQL.\n\nПри редактировании в режиме дизайна комментарии будут потеряны.\n\nВсё равно продолжить?"

